{
  "info": {
    "name": "Kesuburan Tanah — API Key & Validasi",
    "_postman_id": "b7c4d2e1-1111-4222-8333-944455556666",
    "description": "Collection uji POST/GET /api/soil.\n\nSEBELUM RUN:\n1. Postman → Settings → General → SSL certificate verification = OFF (sertifikat lokal self-signed).\n2. Klik nama collection → tab Variables → isi `apiKey` dengan nilai API_KEY dari .env, lalu Save.\n3. Pastikan server jalan: npm run dev → https://localhost:3000\n\nPENTING: request GET memakai Body = none. Kalau Body berisi teks yang bukan JSON sah, express.json() menolak lebih dulu dan balasannya 400 'Body bukan JSON yang sah' — bukan 401. Itu penyebab 400 paling sering.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// timestamp selalu baru, supaya tidak kena batas 7 hari lalu / 10 menit ke depan",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('ts', new Date().toISOString());"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://localhost:3000",
